/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:1:你是一个 ARC-AGI 谜题设计专家。下面的 20 道参考题是难度和机制质量的标杆。仔细阅读每道题的**解题逻辑**（解题者从样例归纳规则的认知过程），而非表面场景。你的新题应在机制深度和隐蔽性上与参考题持平或者实现超越。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:2:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:3:每个参考题描述包含：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:4:- `description`：一句话概述题目的变换目标。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:5:- `Input structure`：输入网格中有哪些对象、背景、标记、边界或组件。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:6:- `Rule`：从输入到输出的确定性变换规则。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:7:- `Key insight`：解题所需的核心洞见。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:8:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:9:参考题目如下：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:10:<reference_puzzle index="1" source="eval" puzzle_id="65b59efc" lines="9-24">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:11:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:12:Decode a stamp map: read templates, markers, and palette from a tiled grid, then render stamps.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:13:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:14:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:15:- Grid divided into K tile columns (each N wide) separated by 1-col dashed separators.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:16:- Top band (rows 0..N-1): K template masks, one per tile column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:17:- Middle band (rows N+1..2N): marker pixels whose color picks a template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:18:- Bottom band (rows 2N+2..): K palette swatches giving the output color per template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:19:- Separator rows at rows N and 2N+1 (dashed pattern of sep color).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:20:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:21:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:22:- Each marker's local position (lr, lc) within its tile column determines which N×N output block to stamp.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:23:- The marker's color identifies which template to use; the palette recolors the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:25:Key insight: Marker color encodes template index; local position within tile column encodes stamp block.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:26:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:27:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:28:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:29:<reference_puzzle index="2" source="eval" puzzle_id="b5ca7ac4" lines="7-21">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:30:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:31:Move bordered 5×5 squares to their designated grid edges by border color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:32:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:33:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:34:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:35:- Azure (8) and red (2) bordered 5×5 squares with colored interiors, scattered across the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:36:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:37:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:38:- Azure squares → left edge (col 0); red squares → right edge (col W−5).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:39:- Each square keeps its original row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:40:- Process azure left-to-right, red right-to-left (nearest-to-edge first).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:41:- If a square's rows overlap an already-placed edge square, place it one square-width inward instead.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:43:Key insight: Near-edge-first ordering plus row-overlap determines which square sits at the edge vs. the second column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:44:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:45:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:46:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:47:<reference_puzzle index="3" source="eval" puzzle_id="142ca369" lines="6-19">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:48:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:49:Trace diagonal rays from triangular arrows, reflecting off colored wall pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:50:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:51:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:52:- bg grid with monochrome 3-pixel L-shaped "arrows" (2x2 bbox missing one corner) and scattered colored wall pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:54:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:55:- Each arrow fires a ray diagonally away from its missing corner, painting bg cells in its color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:56:- A head-on wall hit reverses both axes; a side-touch wall hit flips the touched axis only.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:57:- On any bounce the ray adopts the wall's color and recolors the contact cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:58:- Ray stops when it exits the grid or reaches another arrow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:59:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:60:Key insight: Two distinct reflection types (corner vs side-touch) plus color inheritance at each bounce drive the path geometry.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:61:</description>
