/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:100:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:101:Slide black shapes rightward to a grey separator, then shoot red rays from enclosed holes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:102:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:103:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:104:- A vertical grey (5) separator column divides the grid into left and right halves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:105:- Black shapes sit on the left side against a background color (bg).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:106:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:107:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:108:- Translate each black connected component rightward until its right edge is flush with the separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:109:- After sliding, find enclosed bg regions (holes) within the black shapes that touch the column just left of the separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:110:- For each row spanned by such a hole, emit a red ray across the entire right half of the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:111:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:112:Key insight: Only holes adjacent to the separator trigger rays — the sliding creates enclosures that act as "nozzles" projecting rightward.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:113:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:114:</reference_puzzle>
