/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:136:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:137:Detect thin '+' shapes in a single foreground color and recolor them to teal.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:138:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:139:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:140:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:141:- One foreground color (e.g. yellow) forms various shapes on the bg, some of which are small '+' crosses.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:142:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:143:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:144:- A '+' center is any foreground pixel whose 4 orthogonal neighbors are also foreground.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:145:- Recolor each such center and its 4 neighbors to teal (8).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:146:- All other pixels remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:148:Key insight: Only compact 5-cell crosses qualify — a pixel embedded in a larger filled region also satisfies the neighbor check, so the rule highlights every local '+' motif, not just isolated ones.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:149:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:150:</reference_puzzle>
