/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:153:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:154:Fill holes inside a large template frame using shape-matched outside sprites.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:155:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:156:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:157:- bg = most common color. One large monochrome frame object (template).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:158:- Inside the frame: holes of various shapes (non-frame-color regions).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:159:- Outside the frame: small monochrome sprites scattered on bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:160:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:161:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:162:- Crop to the frame's bounding box; fill entirely with frame color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:163:- For each hole, find an outside sprite whose shape matches (rotation/flip allowed).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:164:- Fill the hole with the matched sprite's color. If multiple sprites match, use the most frequent color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:165:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:166:Key insight: Sprites act as shape-coded color keys — their shape identifies which hole they fill, their color determines the fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed50410689/5/prompt.md:167:</description>
